Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P3 gate: FORCE_NPC_ACTION optional @mode gate

Allow DW3_FORCE_NPC_ACTION=code[@mode][:value] so START_EVENT(4)
(0x9004 → event 9, Digimon Center "download partners now?") can wait
until Asuka Lobby (0x203) on a continuous new-game path without firing
on earlier field modes. Mode mismatch does not consume
dw3_host_menu_force_once().

--- a/src/field/field_mode/field.c	2026-10-10 13:57:31.977334275 -0300
+++ b/src/field/field_mode/field.c	2026-10-10 13:57:23.769289934 -0300
